import "res://assets/dialogue/dialogue_scripts/7d-Az-ConditionalConvo-CellarGeneral.dialogue" as ConditionalConvo

~ start
Fenn: {{EventFlags.winston_name}}?
{{EventFlags.winston_name}}: OH BY POSTLY HEAVEN! WHO'S THERE?!
Fenn: It's me! Fenn?
{{EventFlags.winston_name}}: Oh my. Pint-size...
Fenn: Alright, Wizard man! I'm ready for you, gimme everything you got. I will defeat you and free this palace!
{{EventFlags.winston_name}}: Oh! Yes, um... well you see...
{{EventFlags.winston_name}}: Mine own tools art in the workshop. I wast out looking for something, and-
Az: Oh by the Sender. You're LOST?!
{{EventFlags.winston_name}}: Nay! NAY! I'm not lost! I knoweth mine own way out of here perfectly fine!
{{EventFlags.winston_name}} mumbling: Or at least, I didst.
Az: HAHA HAH. This is GREAT. Boy you really know how to crack me up.
{{EventFlags.winston_name}}: Arrgh. Shut up! 
{{EventFlags.winston_name}} whispering: Hey pint-size... wh-whereth be thine exit?
Fenn: Oh, it's just behind you. I see it there.
{{EventFlags.winston_name}}: Thanks.
Fenn: No problem, happy to help!
{{EventFlags.winston_name}} leaves.
Az: Did you just let him get away?
Fenn: OH WAIT! Come back!!!
{{EventFlags.winston_name}} from afar: UMMM... LALALA I CAN'T HEARETH YOU!
Az: Oh by Post. They're both idiots.
do EventFlags.set_flag("Ws-Lost-HeaterArea", true)

if EventFlags.num_heaters_activated == 0
	=> ConditionalConvo/start

=> END